{"schemaVersion":1,"skill":{"id":"alirezarezvani--claude-skills--design-system","name":"design-system","description":"Captures the user's brand identity once via a 10-question onboarding wizard (primary/accent HEX + heading + body Google Fonts + design style editorial/technical/minimal/playful + default output directory + syntax theme + TOC behavior + optional logo/company), validates body-text and link contrast against WCAG 2.2 AA, derives 12 CSS custom properties in HSL space, and stores the result for every markdown-html converter to consume. Use before any markdown-html conversion. Triggers on first-run onboarding (\"set up the brand\", \"configure markdown-html\", \"run onboarding\"), on explicit reset (\"reset the design system\", \"re-onboard\"), and is checked by every converter via config_loader.py before rendering. Refuses to save if body-text contrast fails AA 4.5:1 or the output dir isn't writable. Precedence is project (./.markdown-html/) > global (~/.config/markdown-html/) > built-in defaults; MARKDOWN_HTML_NO_CONFIG=1 bypasses.","category":"Design","tags":["design","system","captures","user","brand","identity","once","via","10","question","onboarding","wizard","primary","accent","hex","heading","body","google"],"repo":"alirezarezvani/claude-skills","owner":"alirezarezvani","stars":26382,"official":false,"featured":false,"license":"MIT","licensePath":"LICENSE","revision":"19392f7a08264ed00486a251f5b2098321771f94","path":"markdown-html/skills/design-system","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/alirezarezvani/claude-skills/tree/19392f7a08264ed00486a251f5b2098321771f94/markdown-html/skills/design-system","checkedAt":"2026-09-24T09:18:44.317Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-26T13:53:02Z","fileCount":9,"bytes":58211,"sha256":"3696d4b85012b09c6ac7973e003203668d15ab282128e09bc8552e790121d766","historical":false},"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","sourcePath":"markdown-html/skills/design-system/SKILL.md","bytes":11286,"sha256":"3696d4b85012b09c6ac7973e003203668d15ab282128e09bc8552